The main other issue I would bring up with counting a record
file is how often do wands contribute to death in indirect
ways?  If you get ambushed by orcs with a wand of striking
that hurts the worst, what is the chance the death blow
will come from the wand? What if you escape with a ?oT, only
to die later when you could have used that scroll? Or you
retreat somewhere but other monsters get you? What if
you are blinded by a /oL and, fleeing, accidentally kill your
pet, which makes everything much harder for you? What if
